	(text "JP5 sets the supply on J7 pin 1 (default +3V3). J7's signal reaches\nGP46 through R67 = 0R, and R68 is not fitted. GP46 is an ADC pin,\nlimited to IOVDD + 0.5 V. Before moving JP5 to +5V, change R67 and\nfit R68 as a divider."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "162f5096-58a0-4c2a-b6be-4a444c4be727")
	)
	(text "J6: UART connector to the ESP32-C6,\npin compatible with the LM IoT module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
